<<
/Title (Consequently, livelihood continues to be organised through community-based systems similar to the guru-chela structure, where belonging, authority, and income remain interdependent.  The presence of recognition does not eliminate reliance on relational systems, it coexists with it.)
/Dest [25 0 R /Fit]
