<<
/Title (Cooking is not work, cleaning is not work, maintaining a household is not work \(but remove it, and everything else stops\). So what exactly is being described here? Not the absence of labour, but the absence of recognition.)
/Dest [22 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 1140 0 R
/Prev 1146 0 R
/Next 1155 0 R
>>
endobj
